Implement webapplication requirements as below.

Add new project with web application .Net 8
Create a Blazor Web App (Server is simplest).
Web application using chat app RAG pattern to implement.

Chat RAG app allow user to login into system. System just allow logged users.

Chat RAG app will be automatically logged out if user none activated in 5 minutes.

Chat RAG app allow user to use SSO method.

SSO will use google.com, gmail.com to sign in the system.

Chat RAG app allow to connect Qdrant vector database to store chat history.

Chat RAG app allow to insert a bulk of images.

Images will be uploaded into a definition folder.

Images information will be stored in the payload of point struct.

Point struct need to define two different vector data, one for text description of image and one for image embedding data.

When upload an image or a bulk of image, we need to consider to store information of images as bellow: File name, Title of image, Category, Description, Created date, Is actived

Chat RAG app allow to define a MCP server.

Chat RAG app allow to define the max token to send specific LLM model.

Chat RAG app allow to search the text to find the images which stored in Qdrant database through the embedding image data.

The login user will store inside the table in Qdrant database.

Chat RAG app support to load 5 latest history.

Chat RAG app support multiple agents.

Agent supports to chat with specific LLM model.

Agent measure the token input, output, cached.

Agent support to semantic search for specific images.

Agent support to predict the next questions.

Agent support to generate instruction.md file. This purpose help to develop new feature in the future.

Agent support to create a report to show on dashboard what images, text search by a day.

